# Runtime server direct dependencies (editable source of truth).
#
# Lists only the runtime API server's direct dependencies, pinned to exact
# versions. The fully-resolved lock (all transitives + hashes), which is what
# actually gets installed, is generated into requirements-app.txt.
#
# Regenerate the lock after editing this file:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes requirements-app.in -o requirements-app.txt
